WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Triage separates
observations from hypotheses.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.560
Two committed journals
are an observed fact;

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.360
a replay defect is
an explanation that needs review.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.680
Correlate the test, trace
and transfer before grouping failures.

00:00:13.827 --> 00:00:18.400
Route environment problems, product
assertions and unstable reproduction

00:00:18.507 --> 00:00:22.560
to the right owners. Missing
evidence remains unresolved.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:25.680
An approved fix produces
a new build and a new run.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.440
Keep the original failure,

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.200
and never weaken a financial
assertion to obtain a green result.
